msgstr "   ——也就是所有人，因此每个镜头都用同一台摄像机。"

msgid "MULTITRACK NOT POSSIBLE\n  Without an API key there is nothing to send to auphonic.com.\n  With --without-auphonic it runs locally instead: aligned,\n  mixed and cut, but without de-bleed and leveler."
msgstr "无法使用多轨\n  没有 API 密钥，就没有可发送到 auphonic.com 的内容。\n  使用 --without-auphonic 时改为本地运行：对齐、\n  混音并剪辑，但没有 De-Bleed 和 Leveler。"

msgid "\nCAMERA CUT"
msgstr "\n镜头切换"

msgid "\nCUT WITH THE WIDE SHOT"
msgstr "\n使用全景的剪辑"

msgid "\nFIRST CUT BY SPEAKER"
msgstr "\n按说话人的初剪"

msgid "Bright."
msgstr "亮度"

msgid "Colour U"
msgstr "色度 U"

msgid "Colour V"
msgstr "色度 V"

msgid "Distance to mean"
msgstr "与平均值的距离"

msgid "    %-20s shifted by %s ms%s"
msgstr "    %-20s 移动了 %s ms%s"

