msgstr "  由此生成项目、导入和%s："

msgid "  Create it with \"Create Resolve project\" in the interface. Resolve must be running."
msgstr "  请在界面中通过“创建 Resolve 项目”来创建。Resolve 必须正在运行。"

msgid "\nSPEAKERS\n  Nobody was heard -- no camera cut from this."
msgstr "\n说话人\n  没有听到任何人 -- 无法由此生成镜头切换。"

