msgid "no timecode"
msgstr "无时间码"

msgid "Timecode from %s"
msgstr "时间码自 %s 起"

msgid "Separates the recording by voice: every voice gets a row of its own, and its camera in it. About one minute for half an hour of audio, on this machine and without an upload."
msgstr "按声音拆分录音：每个声音各占一行，其摄像机也在该行中。每半小时音频约需一分钟，在本机完成，无需上传。"

msgid "Who is to be heard on this recording. A name means it is that one person.\n\"several speakers\" works out who speaks when, on this machine and without an upload -- about one minute for half an hour of audio. The names then go in the rows underneath."
msgstr "这段录音中能听到谁。填一个名字表示只有这一个人。\n“多位说话人”会在本机、无需上传地确定谁在何时说话 -- 每半小时音频约需一分钟。然后在下面各行填写姓名。"

msgid "Listens to that recording again, looking for one speaker more than was found."
msgstr "再听一遍该录音，寻找比已找到的多一位的说话人。"

msgid "Everything still outstanding, measured against what is done. Long pieces of work take up more of the bar than short ones."
msgstr "所有尚未完成的工作，与已完成的相比较。耗时长的工作在进度条上占的比例比短的大。"

msgid "Measure, align, process, write files."
msgstr "测量、对齐、处理、写入文件。"

msgid "Measure only -- nothing is written or uploaded."
msgstr "仅测量 -- 不写入也不上传任何内容。"

msgid "Key for auphonic.com, and whether Resolve answers."
msgstr "auphonic.com 的密钥，以及 Resolve 是否响应。"

msgid "Why the run cannot start"
msgstr "运行无法开始的原因"

msgid "\nStopping. The run ends as soon as it can do so without leaving a file half written -- one moment.\n"
msgstr "\n正在停止。运行会在不留下写了一半的文件的前提下尽快结束 -- 请稍候。\n"

msgid "%s, seconds"
msgstr "%s，秒"

msgid "%s cannot be placed: its sound has nothing in common with the rest of the material, and the file carries no timecode. It needs one that fits the other recordings, and that has to be set with another program."
msgstr "无法放置 %s：其声音与其余素材毫无共同之处，文件也不带时间码。它需要一个与其他录音相符的时间码，而这必须用其他程序设置。"

msgid "placed on the bands that move"
msgstr "依据变化的频段放置"

msgid "too little audio to align"
msgstr "音频太少，无法对齐"

