msgstr "每个镜头以其摄像机的颜色显示。悬停可查看摄像机和时长，点击即可跳转。"

msgid "Show twice as much (minus key, or the wheel over the band)"
msgstr "显示两倍范围（减号键，或在条带上滚动滚轮）"

msgid "Show half as much, around the current position (plus key, or the wheel over the band)"
msgstr "以当前位置为中心显示一半范围（加号键，或在条带上滚动滚轮）"

msgid "The whole length again (0 key)"
msgstr "恢复完整长度（0 键）"

msgid "Play forward, twice as fast on every press -- the L key."
msgstr "向前播放，每按一次速度加倍 —— L 键。"

msgid "after the device change"
msgstr "设备切换后"

msgid "Audio at programme time"
msgstr "节目时间处的音频"

msgid "External preview -- the app does not know this format"
msgstr "外部预览 —— 应用不认识此格式"

msgid "Play and pause -- the space bar works too."
msgstr "播放和暂停 —— 空格键也可以。"

msgid "The recording assigned to this camera instead of the camera audio."
msgstr "使用分配给这台摄像机的录音，而不是摄像机声音。"

msgid "No player is built in here -- playback runs in ffplay in its own window."
msgstr "这里没有内置播放器 —— 播放在 ffplay 的独立窗口中进行。"

msgid "/not seekable"
msgstr "/不可定位"

msgid "%s: should go to %s%s -- %s"
msgstr "%s：应跳到 %s%s —— %s"

msgid "%s: setPosition(%s), attempt %d, then at %s"
msgstr "%s：setPosition(%s)，第 %d 次尝试，随后位于 %s"

msgid "  Player: %s"
msgstr "  播放器：%s"

msgid "Video 1"
msgstr "画面 1"

msgid "Video 2"
msgstr "画面 2"

msgid "Volume. 100 is as loud as it goes -- Qt takes nothing above that."
msgstr "音量。100 为最大 —— Qt 不接受更高的值。"

msgid "%s reports %s"
msgstr "%s 报告 %s"

msgid "  Player: audio output switches to %s"
msgstr "  播放器：音频输出切换到 %s"

msgid "--- jump to %s programme time%s ---"
msgstr "--- 跳到节目时间 %s%s ---"

msgid "  Player: the audio is not running (%s) -- one more attempt."
msgstr "  播放器：音频没有播放（%s）—— 再试一次。"

msgid "--- point set, programme time runs from %s ---"
msgstr "--- 位置已定，节目时间从 %s 起 ---"

msgid "Clock %7.2f%s | B1[%s] %s | B2[%s] %s | Audio %s %s"
msgstr "时钟 %7.2f%s | B1[%s] %s | B2[%s] %s | 音频 %s %s"

msgid "Prepare pane %d for %s"
msgstr "窗格 %d 准备显示 %s"

msgid "  --  this file is outside"
msgstr "  --  此文件在范围之外"

msgid "%s virtual"
msgstr "%s（虚拟）"

msgid "%s   --   the app does not know this format"
msgstr "%s   --   应用不认识此格式"

msgid "  Player: %s stays at %s instead of %s -- given up after %s attempts (%s)"
msgstr "  播放器：%s 停在 %s 而不是 %s —— 尝试 %s 次后放弃（%s）"

msgid "the default device"
msgstr "默认设备"

msgid "Audio file %s"
msgstr "音频文件 %s"

msgid "Fast forward, %s times speed"
msgstr "快进，%s 倍速"

msgid "Pane %d on %s"
msgstr "窗格 %d 显示 %s"

msgid "Pane %d loads %s (%s)"
msgstr "窗格 %d 加载 %s（%s）"

msgid "   --   audio only"
msgstr "   --   仅音频"

msgid "  (this file starts later)"
msgstr "  （此文件开始得较晚）"

msgid "Playing %s -- the processed track from auphonic.com,\nbrought to broadcast level. The same audio as in the camera cut."
msgstr "正在播放 %s —— 来自 auphonic.com 的处理后音轨，\n已达到广播电平。与镜头切换中的声音相同。"

msgid "Playing %s -- the raw recording.\nIt is much quieter than the processed audio; once the tracks from auphonic.com\nare there, the preview takes those."
msgstr "正在播放 %s —— 原始录音。\n它比处理后的声音安静得多；一旦来自 auphonic.com 的音轨\n到位，预览就会改用它们。"

msgid "%s: not seekable yet, will follow (%s)"
msgstr "%s：暂不可定位，稍后补上（%s）"

msgid " SEEKING"
msgstr " 定位中"

msgid "MUTED"
msgstr "静音"

msgid "  Player: %s reports an error -- %s"
msgstr "  播放器：%s 报告错误 —— %s"

msgid " target %.2f"
msgstr " 目标 %.2f"

msgid "volume %.2f"
msgstr "音量 %.2f"

msgid "the source folder"
msgstr "源文件夹"

msgid "Loudness of the finished episode"
msgstr "成品节目的响度"

msgid "Free space there: %s"
msgstr "那里的可用空间：%s"

msgid "About %s missing. Free up space or choose another folder with --out. The temporary files during the run go somewhere else again, into the system temp folder."
msgstr "大约还缺 %s。请腾出空间，或用 --out 选择另一个文件夹。运行期间的临时文件另放在别处，即系统的临时文件夹。"

msgid "The estimate is rough, so this is not room enough. Free up space or choose another folder with --out."
msgstr "估算较粗略，因此空间不够。请腾出空间，或用 --out 选择另一个文件夹。"

msgid "Disk space"
msgstr "磁盘空间"

msgid "How loud the finished episode is made. The same gain goes on every\ntrack, so the balance between the speakers is kept.\n\"Take from source files\" adjusts nothing at all: auphonic.com goes\non doing what its preset says, and without auphonic.com the sound\nstays as it is in the source files."
msgstr "成品节目的响度。每条音轨施加相同的增益，\n因此说话人之间的平衡保持不变。\n“取自源文件”不做任何调整：auphonic.com 仍按\n其预设处理，不使用 auphonic.com 时声音\n保持源文件原样。"

msgid "Algorithms"
msgstr "算法"

msgid "%s checked"
msgstr "已检查 %s 项"

msgid "    --anyway is set: it runs despite the points above."
msgstr "    已设置 --anyway：尽管有上述问题仍会运行。"

msgid "does the material fit together?"
msgstr "素材是否相互匹配？"

msgid " -- nothing to fault."
msgstr " —— 没有问题。"

msgid "Note: "
msgstr "提示： "

msgid "fixed: "
msgstr "已修正： "

msgid "Caution: "
msgstr "注意： "

msgid "%s fps -- %s, %dx%d, %s frames in %s"
msgstr "%s fps —— %s，%dx%d，%s 帧，时长 %s"

msgid "Uneven frame timing cannot be evened out through the audio. If the sample points spread during alignment as well, convert to a fixed frame rate."
msgstr "不均匀的帧时序无法通过声音校正。如果对齐时采样点也很分散，请转换为固定帧率。"

msgid "Frame rates"
msgstr "帧率"

msgid "The Timeline gets one fixed rate -- the highest of them, or the next rate Resolve has above it. It converts the others; with 23.976 against 24 that is where its audio analysis tends to stall."
msgstr "Timeline 采用一个固定帧率 —— 其中最高的一个，或 Resolve 在其之上的下一个帧率。其余由它转换；在 23.976 对 24 的情况下，它的音频分析往往就卡在这里。"

msgid "Colour space"
msgstr "色彩空间"

msgid "Used as it stands -- nothing is invented. Check in Resolve under Clip Attributes, tab Color Space: if it says \"Project\" there, the input colour space was not recognised and has to be set by hand."
msgstr "按原样采用 -- 不做任何臆造。请在 Resolve 的 Clip Attributes 中的 Color Space 选项卡查看：若显示 \"Project\"，说明输入色彩空间未被识别，需要手动设置。"

msgid "Capture curve"
msgstr "拍摄曲线"

msgid "It is in the logs atom of the picture description -- that is how Resolve recognises the input colour space. Different curves mean different input colour spaces."
msgstr "它位于图像描述的 logs atom 中 -- Resolve 据此识别输入色彩空间。曲线不同，输入色彩空间也不同。"

msgid "Colour tag"
msgstr "色彩标记"

msgid "The three numbers are primaries, curve and matrix. Different tags need different input colour spaces in Resolve -- otherwise one camera looks unlike the other."
msgstr "三个数字分别是原色、曲线和矩阵。标记不同，在 Resolve 中就需要不同的输入色彩空间 -- 否则一台摄像机看起来会和另一台不一样。"

msgid "Resolutions"
msgstr "分辨率"

msgid "Resolve scales to the Timeline resolution. Anything smaller is scaled up and gets softer."
msgstr "Resolve 会缩放到 Timeline 的分辨率。更小的画面会被放大，因而变软。"

msgid "Every pair of channels is judged on its own: one stereo track, or two microphones and therefore two tracks. Silent inputs drop out. The rows under the file say what was measured, and the tick overrules it."
msgstr "每一对声道都单独判断：一条立体声音轨，或两支麦克风因而两条音轨。无声的输入会被舍弃。文件下方的行显示测量结果，勾选可覆盖它。"

msgid "Counted here, sample by sample, at the rate the file was recorded at: a run of three or more samples on the highest value an integer format can hold. One or two are rounding and are not reported. What is cut off there is gone and no processing brings it back -- but the recording is still the recording, and this holds nothing up. Only integer formats are counted. 32 bit float has no stop at full scale, so there is nothing there to count."
msgstr "这里按文件录制时的采样率逐个采样计数：在整数格式所能容纳的最大值上连续出现三个或更多采样。一两个属于舍入，不予报告。在那里被削掉的部分已经丢失，任何处理都无法恢复 -- 但录音仍然是录音，这不会阻挡任何事情。只统计整数格式。32 bit float 在满刻度处没有上限，因此那里无可计数。"

msgid "Midnight"
msgstr "午夜"

msgid "A timecode counts from midnight and starts over there. The files are put on one axis before anything is subtracted, otherwise the recording after midnight looks almost a day away from the one before. If these really were recorded on different days, the alignment is wrong and the measured offset is the one to trust."
msgstr "时间码从午夜开始计数，并在午夜重新开始。在做任何相减之前，文件会被放到同一条轴上，否则午夜之后的录音看起来会和之前的录音相隔将近一天。如果它们确实是在不同的日子录制的，那么对齐就是错的，应以测得的偏移为准。"

msgid "Alignment goes by the measured offset; the timecode is only the cross-check."
msgstr "对齐以测得的偏移为准；时间码只用于核对。"

msgid "not measurable."
msgstr "无法测量。"

msgid "no place found where exactly one person speaks -- the separation cannot be measured."
msgstr "未找到恰好只有一个人说话的地方 -- 无法测量分离度。"

msgid "3:1 rule"
msgstr "3:1 规则"

msgid "This comes from the recording, not afterwards: the microphones sit too close together or too far from the mouth."
msgstr "这源于录音本身，而非后期：麦克风彼此离得太近，或离嘴太远。"

msgid "free %s, about %s needed (%s)"
msgstr "可用 %s，约需 %s（%s）"

msgid "taken from the source files, no --lufs given -- nothing is adjusted"
msgstr "取自源文件，未指定 --lufs -- 不做任何调整"

msgid "none switched on"
msgstr "均未开启"

msgid "\nPREFLIGHT -- %s"
msgstr "\n预检 -- %s"

msgid "\nStopped before the first long step. With --anyway it runs regardless."
msgstr "\n在第一个耗时步骤之前停止。加上 --anyway 则照样运行。"

msgid "no video track"
msgstr "无视频轨道"

msgid "Frame spacing varies by %s %% -- the frame timing is uneven."
msgstr "帧间隔波动 %s %% -- 帧时序不均匀。"

msgid "the video files run at different rates: %s"
msgstr "视频文件的帧率不同：%s"

msgid "%s of %s video files carry no curve and no colour space in the colr box%s -- probably log material."
msgstr "%s 个（共 %s 个）视频文件在 colr 盒中既无曲线也无色彩空间%s -- 可能是 Log 素材。"

msgid "the video files carry different recording curves: %s"
msgstr "视频文件带有不同的拍摄曲线：%s"

msgid "the video files are tagged differently: %s"
msgstr "视频文件的色彩标记不同：%s"

msgid "the video files have different picture sizes: %s"
msgstr "视频文件的画面尺寸不同：%s"

msgid "%s kHz instead of %s kHz -- converted during processing."
msgstr "%s kHz 而非 %s kHz -- 处理时会转换。"

msgid "%s channels -- cut into tracks, see the rows above."
msgstr "%s 个声道 -- 拆分为音轨，见上面的行。"

msgid "Channel %d is against the stop: %s times three samples or more in a row, the longest %s (%s ms), the first at %s."
msgstr "声道 %d 触顶：连续三个或更多采样共 %s 次，最长 %s（%s ms），首次在 %s。"

msgid "Started late or stopped early -- this voice is then missing from the mix in places."
msgstr "开始过晚或停止过早 -- 这个声音在混音中会有部分缺失。"

msgid "%s carries a timecode from the other side of midnight -- counted as one night, not as a day apart."
msgstr "%s 的时间码位于午夜的另一侧 -- 按同一夜计算，而不是相隔一天。"

msgid "Timecode %s, the other files are at %s -- this clock was not set."
msgstr "时间码 %s，其他文件在 %s -- 这个时钟没有设置过。"

msgid "the recordings overlap only %s -- too little to measure."
msgstr "录音仅重叠 %s -- 太短，无法测量。"

msgid "the shortest recording has only %s -- too little to measure."
msgstr "最短的录音只有 %s -- 太短，无法测量。"

msgid "%s of %s comparisons are below %s dB -- every recording against every other, in both directions."
msgstr "%s 次（共 %s 次）比较低于 %s dB -- 每个录音都与其他每个录音双向比较。"

msgid "Target: %s"
msgstr "目标位置：%s"

msgid "%s is set, and nothing is adjusted here: the tracks leave as they were recorded, and the loudness is set where they are mixed."
msgstr "已设置 %s，此处不做任何调整：音轨按录制原样输出，响度在混音处设定。"

msgid "Track template"
msgstr "轨道模板"

msgid "the Multitrack preset has no track stored."
msgstr "Multitrack 预设中没有存储任何轨道。"

msgid "The first preset track sets the settings for all our tracks. Otherwise they come back unprocessed. Create a track in the preset in the web interface."
msgstr "预设中的第一条轨道决定我们所有轨道的设置。否则轨道会未经处理地返回。请在网页界面中为预设创建一条轨道。"

msgid "per track"
msgstr "每条轨道"

msgid " -- 1 note: %s"
msgstr " -- 1 条提示：%s"

msgid " -- %s notes"
msgstr " -- %s 条提示"

msgid "multi-part, no timecode -- gaps in between cannot be detected."
msgstr "分为多段，无时间码 -- 无法检测其间的空隙。"

msgid "The cut has no picture there. When the Timeline is built the spot stays empty, the audio runs on."
msgstr "剪辑在那里没有画面。构建 Timeline 时该处留空，声音继续。"

msgid "only %s long, the longest recording has %s."
msgstr "只有 %s 长，最长的录音有 %s。"

msgid "%s%s in %s's microphone only %s dB quieter"
msgstr "%s%s 在 %s 的麦克风中仅低 %s dB"

msgid "%s in %s's microphone: %s dB quieter than in their own."
msgstr "%s 在 %s 的麦克风中：比在自己的麦克风中低 %s dB。"

msgid "It arose during the recording and cannot be changed now. The less the microphones are separated, the more cautiously De-Bleed at auphonic.com can work. Next time: three times as far from the neighbouring microphone as from your own mouth, then the neighbouring voice sits about %s dB lower."
msgstr "这是录音时产生的，现在已无法改变。麦克风分离得越差，auphonic.com 的 De-Bleed 就只能越保守地工作。下次：与相邻麦克风的距离应是与自己嘴巴距离的三倍，这样相邻的声音大约低 %s dB。"

msgid "not readable (%s) -- unchecked."
msgstr "无法读取（%s） -- 未检查。"

msgid "the preset masters to %s LUFS -- that stands, nothing of ours adjusts."
msgstr "预设母带处理到 %s LUFS -- 以此为准，我们这边不做任何调整。"

msgid "the preset masters to %s LUFS, the calculation uses %s."
msgstr "预设母带处理到 %s LUFS，计算使用的是 %s。"

msgid "Both at once does not work: the returning tracks would go to one value, our own mix to the other. Either set --lufs %.0f or change the preset."
msgstr "两者不能同时成立：返回的音轨会达到一个值，我们自己的混音会达到另一个值。请设置 --lufs %.0f 或修改预设。"

msgid "the track template has nothing switched on -- the tracks would come back exactly as uploaded."
msgstr "轨道模板中没有开启任何功能 -- 音轨会按上传时的原样返回。"

msgid "Check"
msgstr "检查"

msgid "not readable: %s"
msgstr "无法读取：%s"

msgid "%s fps, not the %s in the file -- %s more frames in the same length."
msgstr "%s fps，而非文件中的 %s -- 同样长度内多出 %s 帧。"

msgid "%s fps, not the %s in the file -- %s fewer frames in the same length."
msgstr "%s fps，而非文件中的 %s -- 同样长度内少了 %s 帧。"

msgid "The frames stand a little shorter; the file is not any longer for it. Editing software leaves out about one frame every %s s, and picture and camera audio stay together."
msgstr "每帧显示时间稍短；文件并不会因此变长。剪辑软件大约每 %s 秒省略一帧，画面与摄像机声音保持同步。"

msgid "The frames stand a little longer; the file is not any shorter for it. Editing software repeats about one frame every %s s, and picture and camera audio stay together."
msgstr "每帧显示时间稍长；文件并不会因此变短。剪辑软件大约每 %s 秒重复一帧，画面与摄像机声音保持同步。"

msgid " -- only the matrix says BT.2020"
msgstr " -- 只有矩阵标为 BT.2020"

msgid "Gap of %s between block %d and %d -- the camera stopped."
msgstr "%s 的空隙，位于第 %d 个片段与第 %d 个片段之间 -- 摄像机停过。"

msgid " from %s files"
msgstr " （来自 %s 个文件）"

msgid "the check itself stopped: %s"
msgstr "检查本身中断了：%s"

msgid "%s in %s"
msgstr "%s：%s"

msgid "Limits the de-bleed: "
msgstr "限制 De-Bleed："

msgid "not measurable: %s"
msgstr "无法测量：%s"

msgid "Envelope"
msgstr "包络"

msgid "Cutting out track %d of %d"
msgstr "正在切出音轨 %d / %d"

msgid "no audio: %s"
msgstr "无音频：%s"

msgid "Envelope failed: %s"
msgstr "包络失败：%s"

msgid "channels not readable: %s"
msgstr "无法读取声道：%s"

msgid "cutting failed: %s"
msgstr "切出失败：%s"

msgid "Everything comes back from it: names, separation, assignment, types, the time window. The list of files is replaced by the one the project holds."
msgstr "一切都从中恢复：名称、分离、分配、类型、时间窗。文件列表会被项目中保存的列表替换。"

msgid "PROJECT OPENED\n  All entries are back, nothing has been computed in this session.\n  The output folder holds the files of the last run:\n  %s\n\n  Three ways from here:\n    • below \"Open result folder\" -- look at the files from that run,\n    • below \"Create Resolve project\" -- from that run's handover file,\n      without computing anything again,\n    • above \"Start\" -- compute everything again and overwrite the files.\n"
msgstr "项目已打开\n  所有设置都已恢复，本次会话中尚未计算任何内容。\n  输出文件夹中是上次运行的文件：\n  %s\n\n  接下来有三种做法：\n    • 下方\"打开结果文件夹\" -- 查看那次运行的文件，\n    • 下方\"创建 Resolve 项目\" -- 使用那次运行的交接文件，\n      无需重新计算，\n    • 上方\"开始\" -- 全部重新计算并覆盖文件。\n"

msgid "Restart the application"
msgstr "重新启动应用程序"

msgid "The application is about to start again. Shall the work be written to a project file first?"
msgstr "应用程序即将重新启动。是否先将工作写入项目文件？"

msgid "Written, the new window opens the project again and everything stands where it stood. Not written, it comes up empty and the files have to be added afresh."
msgstr "若写入，新窗口会重新打开项目，一切保持原样。若不写入，新窗口将为空，需要重新添加文件。"

msgid "Save and restart"
msgstr "保存并重新启动"

msgid "Restart without saving"
msgstr "不保存直接重新启动"

msgid "Several project files lie with this material. Which one?\n\n%s"
msgstr "此素材旁有多个项目文件。选哪一个？\n\n%s"

msgid "The project file goes into the output folder, and none is chosen yet. Please choose one."
msgstr "项目文件会保存到输出文件夹，但尚未选择输出文件夹。请选择一个。"

msgid "A project file lies with this material:\n\n  %s\n  written %s\n\n%s"
msgstr "此素材旁有一个项目文件：\n\n  %s\n  写入于 %s\n\n%s"

msgid "PROJECT SAVED\n  %s\n  This run can be opened again later -- top left\n  \"Open project ...\"\n\n"
msgstr "项目已保存\n  %s\n  以后可以重新打开这次运行 -- 左上角\n  \"打开项目 ...\"\n\n"

msgid "Open json project file"
msgstr "打开 json 项目文件"

msgid "This is not a project file, and there is none in the same folder.\n\nThe search is for %s*.json -- the script writes it into the output folder at start."
msgstr "这不是项目文件，同一文件夹中也没有。\n\n查找的是 %s*.json -- 脚本会在启动时将其写入输出文件夹。"

msgid "These files no longer exist:\n  "
msgstr "这些文件已不存在：\n  "

msgid "  Project file not writable (%s)\n"
msgstr "  项目文件无法写入（%s）\n"

msgid "Video Podcast Magic (%s*.json);;JSON files (*.json);;All files (*)"
msgstr "Video Podcast Magic (%s*.json);;JSON 文件 (*.json);;所有文件 (*)"

msgid "This handover carries no frame rate, so the timeline cannot be built from it. Please make the run again."
msgstr "此交接文件没有帧率，因此无法据此构建 Timeline。请重新运行一次。"

msgid "This Resolve project already exists"
msgstr "此 Resolve 项目已存在"

msgid "Too many projects with this name."
